OL,3,AKit Harington replaces Nicholas Hoult
OL,4,Ain HBO's Harry Potter series
OL,5,
OL,6,FBest known for playing Jon Snow for
OL,7,Feight seasons in the award-winning
OL,8,Fseries Game of Thrones, Harington also
OL,9,Fappears in the BBC and HBO financial
OL,10,Fdrama Industry. The star previously
OL,11,Fvoiced Lockhart in the audio version of
OL,12,FHarry Potter.
OL,14,F"I'm a huge Potter fan. I've got to be
OL,15,Fhonest, he's one of my favourite
OL,16,Fcharacters," Harington told Collider.
OL,17,F"So, to be offered to play him is a
OL,18,Freal dream. I've had a taste of him (in
OL,19,Fthe audiobook) and felt my way around
OL,20,Fhim. He's just a wonderful creation."
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
